# Swarm runtime state (events log, optional .env, task queues).
# coordinator.md describes everything here as runtime artifacts.
.swarm/

# Repo-root .env for personal-machine overrides (MAX_WORKERS, FAND_DATA_ROOT, etc.).
# Shipped defaults live in .env.example (tracked); per-project durable overrides
# go in <project>/.swarm/.env (gitignored above). Root-only — anchored with the
# leading slash so it does NOT shadow .env files inside subdirs that might
# legitimately be tracked.
/.env

